  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\"><img alt=\"Fredrik Johansson\" class=\"rounded-full w-24 h-24 object-cover\" src=\"/assets/fredrik-johansson-388c6379.jpg\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl mb-2\">Fredrik Johansson</h1></div><div class=\"flex-shrink\"><p class=\"text-neutral-600 text-lg\">Fredrik Johansson has been writing for Bidders Highway since 2023.</p></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 my-8 lg:my-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-8\">Articles by Fredrik Johansson</h2><div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><a href=\"/en/posts/washing-guide-interior\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/802b0d124a63891d4313abc89c58efaf\" alt=\"Washing Guide: Interior\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 hover:text-blue-600\">Washing Guide: Interior</h3><p class=\"text-neutral-600 mb-3 line-clamp-3\">A clean exterior is certainly fun, but the interior is where you actually spend most of your time. Time to pull out the bag of peanuts and the kids' forgotten sandwiches and get the inside looking brand new.</p><span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">April 27, 2023 15:25</span></div></a></article><article class=\"border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><a href=\"/en/posts/the-washing-guide-exterior\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/b830e6e598b384d8792f8c8edeca29e3\" alt=\"The Washing Guide: Exterior\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 hover:text-blue-600\">The Washing Guide: Exterior</h3><p class=\"text-neutral-600 mb-3 line-clamp-3\">Spring is just around the corner. Time to bring out the gem? Or is it a new acquisition that should shine like never before? Then let's grab the wash bucket!</p><span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">April 14, 2023 15:00</span></div></a></article><article class=\"border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><a href=\"/en/posts/guide-change-of-ownership\"><div class=\"aspect-video bg-neutral-100\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/c745928ef585c387866d2f8e9d4c9161\" alt=\"Guide: Change of Ownership\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 hover:text-blue-600\">Guide: Change of Ownership</h3><p class=\"text-neutral-600 mb-3 line-clamp-3\">Valuable tips and information on how to proceed with a change of ownership.</p><span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">April 05, 2023 14:00</span></div></a></article></div></div></article></main>",
